.TH REPEAT 1.SH NAMErepeat \- run a command several times.SH SYNOPSIS\fBrepeat\fRcount command [arguments].SH DESCRIPTION\fBrepeat\fRruns\fIcommand\fR\fIcount\fRtimes, one after another:\fBrepeat 3 echo hello\fRprints three lines.  It hands the command to the shell named by\fBSHELL\fR.\fRA command that writes no line end, like\fBdate\fR,\fRruns its repeats together on one line..SH SEE ALSOevery